    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With 2 untapped lands (Mountain + Sunbillow Verge) and the opponent having lost life this turn from Hired Claw attack triggers, Qwen3 Drama could have activated a Hired Claw's pump ability ({1}{R}) to permanently put a +1/+1 counter on it, making it a 2/3. This is a permanent, repeatable advantage that costs nothing since there's no better use for the mana. Alternatively, Lightning Helix to face for 3 damage + 3 life is strong but saving it for creature removal is defensible.",
      "action_taken": "Passed without using any mana during combat, leaving 2 lands untapped with no instant-speed plays likely needed on opponent's turn.",
      "better_line": "Activate Hired Claw's pump ability for {1}{R} to put a +1/+1 counter on it, gaining a permanent stat boost at no real cost since the activation condition (opponent lost life) was met.",
      "type": "blunder",
