      "better_line": "Cast Burst Lightning targeting opponent (2 damage, putting them to 6). This enables Hired Claw's +1/+1 counter abilities since opponent lost life. Then attack with all creatures for massive damage, and use Lightning Helix post-combat if needed to finish. Alternatively, just attack first and burn post-combat, but pre-combat Burst Lightning enables Hired Claw counters and also triggers Emberheart Challenger's prowess.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 97,
