      "decision_index": 104,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Opponent is at 8 life. Qwen3 Drama has Lightning Helix (3 damage) and Burst Lightning (2 damage) in hand, totaling 5 burn damage. With 4 creatures attacking plus 2 Hired Claw triggers (2 damage), the attack alone deals significant damage. But more importantly, casting Burst Lightning (2 damage) + Lightning Helix (3 damage) = 5 damage, plus the 2 Hired Claw triggers (2 damage from attacking with Lizards) = 7 damage before combat damage. With any creature getting through, that's lethal. Even without combat damage, the attack triggers deal 2 and burn deals 5 = 7, and the opponent has no blockers visible, so 4 creatures attacking would deal additional combat damage for certain lethal. By not casting burn spells before or during combat, Qwen3 Drama risks the opponent having interaction (removal, fog effects) that could prevent lethal. The opponent has 5 lands including Maelstrom of the Spirit Dragon which could be sacrificed for value. Casting burn pre-combat guarantees the kill regardless of blocks or tricks.",
